#. module: sale_order_payment_state
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_order_payment_state.field_sale_order__invoice_payment_state
msgid ""
"Payment status of the posted customer invoices and credit notes of this "
"order. Draft invoices and fully reversed invoices are ignored. It does not "
"tell whether the order is fully invoiced: check the Invoice Status for that."
msgstr ""
"Estado de pago de las facturas de cliente y notas de crédito publicadas de "
"este pedido. Se ignoran las facturas en borrador y las facturas revertidas "
"por completo. No indica si el pedido está completamente facturado: consulte "
"el estado de facturación para ello."

